    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500400/extras/aa4a72e6f9d12f38935185291059dafd.poster.avif?t=1744030864\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500400/extras/aa4a72e6f9d12f38935185291059dafd.webm?t=1744030864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500400/extras/aa4a72e6f9d12f38935185291059dafd.mp4?t=1744030864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br>Prepare to confront fresh challenges and forge unexpected alliances in a world teeming with new enemies, allies, and enigmatic powers. <br><br>Delve into the mysteries of an Ancient Dungeon-City, crafted by minds consumed with magic and madness. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500400/extras/f4f002c39a77dad7bbef0dd37bbf24ab.poster.avif?t=1744030864\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500400/extras/f4f002c39a77dad7bbef0dd37bbf24ab.webm?t=1744030864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500400/extras/f4f002c39a77dad7bbef0dd37bbf24ab.mp4?t=1744030864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Navigate labyrinthine passages, battle fearsome foes, and unravel the secrets hidden within its walls.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500400/extras/1bb531d857719c73f4efbe99aca2508d.poster.avif?t=1744030864\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500400/extras/1bb531d857719c73f4efbe99aca2508d.webm?t=1744030864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500400/extras/1bb531d857719c73f4efbe99aca2508d.mp4?t=1744030864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Join forces with a fearless warrior companion as you embark on an odyssey filled with peril and discovery. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500400/extras/2447ee2669706a822476e28a70782617.poster.avif?t=1744030864\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500400/extras/2447ee2669706a822476e28a70782617.webm?t=1744030864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500400/extras/2447ee2669706a822476e28a70782617.mp4?t=1744030864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Arm yourself with newfound weapons and abilities, honing your skills to overcome the formidable adversaries that stand between you and the exit of this mystical labyrinth. <br><br>Will you emerge triumphant, or will the city's arcane secrets consume you?<br><br><strong>Developer Note: </strong><br><br>This game is a 2008 artifact developed by a small indie team using the full potential and limitations of flash technology. We apologize for any technical problems or inconveniences you may encounter in your playthrough, or issues with the German and Spanish translations. We hope that with these limitations in mind, you may still enjoy the experience!<br><br>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500400/extras/aa4a72e6f9d12f38935185291059dafd.poster.avif?t=1744030864\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500400/extras/aa4a72e6f9d12f38935185291059dafd.webm?t=1744030864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500400/extras/aa4a72e6f9d12f38935185291059dafd.mp4?t=1744030864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br>Prepare to confront fresh challenges and forge unexpected alliances in a world teeming with new enemies, allies, and enigmatic powers. <br><br>Delve into the mysteries of an Ancient Dungeon-City, crafted by minds consumed with magic and madness. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500400/extras/f4f002c39a77dad7bbef0dd37bbf24ab.poster.avif?t=1744030864\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500400/extras/f4f002c39a77dad7bbef0dd37bbf24ab.webm?t=1744030864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500400/extras/f4f002c39a77dad7bbef0dd37bbf24ab.mp4?t=1744030864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Navigate labyrinthine passages, battle fearsome foes, and unravel the secrets hidden within its walls.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500400/extras/1bb531d857719c73f4efbe99aca2508d.poster.avif?t=1744030864\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500400/extras/1bb531d857719c73f4efbe99aca2508d.webm?t=1744030864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500400/extras/1bb531d857719c73f4efbe99aca2508d.mp4?t=1744030864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Join forces with a fearless warrior companion as you embark on an odyssey filled with peril and discovery. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500400/extras/2447ee2669706a822476e28a70782617.poster.avif?t=1744030864\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500400/extras/2447ee2669706a822476e28a70782617.webm?t=1744030864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500400/extras/2447ee2669706a822476e28a70782617.mp4?t=1744030864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Arm yourself with newfound weapons and abilities, honing your skills to overcome the formidable adversaries that stand between you and the exit of this mystical labyrinth. <br><br>Will you emerge triumphant, or will the city's arcane secrets consume you?<br><br><strong>Developer Note: </strong><br><br>This game is a 2008 artifact developed by a small indie team using the full potential and limitations of flash technology. We apologize for any technical problems or inconveniences you may encounter in your playthrough, or issues with the German and Spanish translations. We hope that with these limitations in mind, you may still enjoy the experience!<br><br>",
